error[E0277]: `impl futures::Future<Output = impl Stream<Item = Patches<Feed>>>` is not a stream of `Patches<Feed>` a stream's handler returns
  --> tests/ui/fail/stream_handler_async.rs:12:1
   |
12 | / hypersig::routes! {
13 | |     fn actions(Router<()>);
14 | |     stream UPDATES: StreamAction<Feed> = "/updates" => updates;
15 | | }
   | |_^ the trait `PatchStream<Feed>` is not implemented for `impl futures::Future<Output = impl Stream<Item = Patches<Feed>>>`
   |
   = note: a stream's handler is a plain `fn` returning a `Stream<Item = Patches<Feed>> + Send + 'static`; an `async fn` returns a future, which is not a stream
note: required by a bound in `hypersig::RouterExt::stream`
  --> src/axum.rs
   |
   |     fn stream<S, A, H, M, Str>(self, stream: StreamAction<S, A>, handler: H) -> Self
   |        ------ required by a bound in this associated function
...
   |         Str: PatchStream<S>;
   |              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ required by this bound in `RouterExt::stream`
   = note: this error originates in the macro `$crate::routes` which comes from the expansion of the macro `hypersig::routes` (in Nightly builds, run with -Z macro-backtrace for more info)
